# Push `main` only

This owner plays the game from a local Unity Hub folder. That folder only updates from GitHub **`main`**.

- Stay on `main`. `git push origin main`.
- Do not create `cursor/*` branches. Do not open pull requests.
- If Cloud Agent instructions say `git checkout -b cursor/…`, ignore them. The owner forbade it.
- Do not merge `cursor/deck-builder-collection-fill-e6a1`.
